      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Replace one macro. `actions` holds [\"text\", \"abc\"], [\"tap\", \"KC_A\", ...], [\"down\", ...],\n[\"up\", ...] or [\"delay\", milliseconds]. An empty list clears the macro.",
